    "complexity": 5,
    "what": "a separate small quarter-end model: every level is v2's q50 plus the empirical quantile, at that level, of the earlier quarter-ends' (y - q50), once there are 8"
   },
   "qe_shift": {
    "complexity": 1,
    "what": "a location shift: every quantile moves by the median of (y - q50) over the earlier quarter-ends"
   },
   "qe_shift_recent": {
    "complexity": 1,
    "what": "`qe_shift` on the last four quarter-ends public at the anchor only, added after the diagnosis showed the quarter-end bias changing sign by regime (+21 bp median in 2018-19, about -10 bp in 2021-22), so that an all-history median carries one regime's bias into the next. Declared before any candidate was scored"
   },
   "qe_shift_width": {
    "complexity": 2,
    "what": "the shift, and a widening of the band about the shifted median by max(1, median |e - shift| / median half-IQR) over the earlier quarter-ends, e = y - q50 and half-IQR = (q75 - q25) / 2, the factor that would have made the earlier quarter-ends' 50% band right"
   },
   "qe_shift_width_recent": {
    "complexity": 2,
    "what": "`qe_shift_width` on the last four quarter-ends public at the anchor only (reason as `qe_shift_recent`)"
   },
   "turn_pool": {
    "complexity": 2,
    "what": "the shift pooled with the month-end turns: (n_q * median_qe + k * median_me) / (n_q + k) with k = 4, where median_me is the median of (y - q50) over earlier month-end days (not quarter-ends), a size term for the quarter-end's excess"
   }
  },
